{
  "name": "Elemental Defense: Searing Flesh",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you gain access to this element, as a Bonus Action, you can superheat your body to extreme temperatures, which lasts until you dismiss the effect (no action required).</p><p>While the effect is active and you aren't wearing any armor or shield, your AC equals 10 + your Dexterity modifier + your Charisma modifier and any creature that touches you or hits you with a melee attack from within 10 feet of you takes fire damage equal to your Charisma modifier.</p><p>This effect is exclusive with Elemental Defense class features from other Elemental Schools.</p>",
